1
00:00:04,860 --> 00:00:06,380
Seven years later,

2
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:07,880
in 1888,

3
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:13,740
Jack the Ripper stalked
the streets of London,

4
00:00:13,940 --> 00:00:18,880
murdering women in the night and holding
the entire city in his thrall. However,

5
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:22,437
he was nothing compared to
the horror that the feud

6
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:25,480
between JoJo and D would
unleash upon the world.

7
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:39,720
Let's go.

8
00:01:00,920 --> 00:01:06,100
The way of the journey
is brought to heaven.

9
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:08,077
We stand for the two years.

10
00:01:08,160 --> 00:01:12,540
The world we call our heart. What is it?

11
00:01:19,620 --> 00:01:25,320
It's been to the heart of hearts

12
00:01:45,360 --> 00:01:48,177
I'll see you

13
00:01:48,260 --> 00:01:54,660
next time.

14
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:09,190
Interception!

15
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:12,400
The ball is plucked out
of the air by our hero,

16
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:14,560
Jonathan Joestar!

17
00:02:19,720 --> 00:02:20,550
Joestar,

18
00:02:20,633 --> 00:02:25,760
a gentle giant at 195 centimeters, Sprint
for the Tri-Zone with a spirited roar!

19
00:02:26,760 --> 00:02:27,940
Can he win this?

20
00:02:28,060 --> 00:02:30,354
The last game of his university career!

21
00:02:31,620 --> 00:02:33,420
He's tackled from behind!

22
00:02:34,640 --> 00:02:35,470
Wait!

23
00:02:35,553 --> 00:02:36,940
He's still standing tall!

24
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:39,140
Two more fly in!

25
00:02:40,100 --> 00:02:42,040
It's three on one out there!

26
00:02:48,140 --> 00:02:48,970
Incredible!

27
00:02:49,053 --> 00:02:53,740
He's still making for the try line,
undaunted by the men who dog his steps!

28
00:02:54,500 --> 00:02:56,820
What power, what determination!

29
00:02:57,380 --> 00:02:58,760
He's Hercules reborn!

30
00:02:59,940 --> 00:03:01,200
Another tackle!

31
00:03:02,660 --> 00:03:05,140
Oh, the weight's too much for him!

32
00:03:08,700 --> 00:03:12,420
He flings it away and... Yes!

33
00:03:13,140 --> 00:03:14,380
There's the catch!

34
00:03:14,640 --> 00:03:17,137
The ball lands safe in
the hands of Diobrando!

35
00:03:17,220 --> 00:03:19,300
So, it's still anyone's game!

36
00:03:23,580 --> 00:03:25,220
Can he make it?

37
00:03:25,420 --> 00:03:27,680
He dodges one and another!

38
00:03:28,180 --> 00:03:29,200
He's done it!

39
00:03:29,340 --> 00:03:34,105
There's nothing left between Dio and the
try line, and still he gives it his all!

40
00:03:34,340 --> 00:03:35,170
Yes!

41
00:03:35,720 --> 00:03:37,280
They did it!

42
00:03:37,820 --> 00:03:41,702
On the last play, they snatched
victory out of the jaws of defeat!

43
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:42,820
What teamwork!

44
00:03:43,300 --> 00:03:47,006
When Jojo and Dio work together,
there's nothing they can't do!

45
00:03:47,220 --> 00:03:48,460
Hell of a pass, Jojo.

46
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:51,017
All for naught if you hadn't
run it in like you did.

47
00:03:51,100 --> 00:03:54,865
Watching you drag those defenders,
I couldn't just let you down.

48
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:59,353
Having finished his studies, Dio is
set to graduate with top marks in law.

49
00:03:59,860 --> 00:04:04,507
Jojo, meanwhile, has set the faculty
afire with his bold thesis on archaeology.

50
00:04:05,180 --> 00:04:08,300
On and off the field, these
two young men are giants.

51
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:10,562
They're the pride of our school.

52
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:14,877
Jojo, I think we should tell our father
about this victory of ours at once.

53
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:15,790
Hmm.

54
00:04:21,840 --> 00:04:26,000
It's been seven years now since my
father welcomed Dio into our home.

55
00:04:26,440 --> 00:04:27,900
Seven long years.

56
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:30,940
I smile and treat him as a brother,

57
00:04:31,220 --> 00:04:34,460
but in my heart, nothing can
be further from the truth.

58
00:04:35,260 --> 00:04:38,560
He's nothing if not affable,
and smart as a whip.

59
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:45,920
But I just can't forgive him
for his early villainies.

60
00:04:46,840 --> 00:04:50,477
Dio, might you give us a quote
about your friendship with Jojo?

61
00:04:50,560 --> 00:04:51,637
You seem quite close.

62
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:53,837
Right about the team, all of us!

63
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:56,640
Come on, tell us how close you are?

64
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:58,340
Hmm, should I?

65
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:01,941
Friendship, huh?

66
00:05:02,280 --> 00:05:05,977
The truth is I despise
this grinning imbecile.

67
00:05:06,060 --> 00:05:10,237
I've spent seven years making
nice to that Joestar brat.

68
00:05:10,320 --> 00:05:15,260
But now that I am of age I shall
bring my plans to fruition!

69
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:19,340
At long last, the Joestar
fortune will be mine.

70
00:05:19,620 --> 00:05:22,520
And devil take anyone
who tries to stop me.

71
00:05:28,060 --> 00:05:30,400
Father, how are you feeling today?

72
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:34,800
But for this cough, much
improved over yesterday.

73
00:05:36,340 --> 00:05:39,820
The doctors say I should
be in the hospital. Why?

74
00:05:40,100 --> 00:05:42,020
I fear it would do you no good.

75
00:05:42,980 --> 00:05:45,020
Hospitals only care about profit.

76
00:05:45,260 --> 00:05:48,495
They'd measure you for a
shroud ere they saw you cured.

77
00:05:49,100 --> 00:05:50,700
Then here I shall remain.

78
00:05:50,980 --> 00:05:53,686
The comforts of home are
curative like as not.

79
00:05:54,420 --> 00:05:58,420
My chest doesn't pain me so,
and the swelling has gone down.

80
00:05:59,520 --> 00:06:00,680
I'm on the mend.

81
00:06:00,880 --> 00:06:02,000
It was just a cold.

82
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,880
Why has it worsened so?

83
00:06:05,100 --> 00:06:06,900
I heard tell of your victory.

84
00:06:07,160 --> 00:06:08,631
Stunning bit of teamwork.

85
00:06:09,300 --> 00:06:10,840
Someone told you about it?

86
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:14,237
I got word straight away
from an old college chum.

87
00:06:14,320 --> 00:06:16,200
Whoever he is, he's fast.

88
00:06:16,460 --> 00:06:20,284
I'm glad he wasn't on our opponent's
team, or we could have lost.

89
00:06:20,940 --> 00:06:22,440
I'm proud of you, lads.

90
00:06:22,700 --> 00:06:24,620
You both turned out so well.

91
00:06:25,120 --> 00:06:26,520
Providence is too kind.

92
00:06:27,520 --> 00:06:29,860
Dio, I'm so glad you've thrived.

93
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:33,068
Pursue your ambitions,
whatever they may be.

94
00:06:33,580 --> 00:06:37,000
I will lend you aid in
any way I can, my son.

95
00:06:37,840 --> 00:06:39,980
You rescued me from calamity.

96
00:06:40,320 --> 00:06:43,085
Already, my debt is more
than I can ever repay.

97
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:45,800
Hey, you do me too much honor.

98
00:07:00,640 --> 00:07:02,360
This secret is mine alone.

99
00:07:02,820 --> 00:07:07,520
I can't imagine for what purpose this
mask may have been fashioned, or by whom.

100
00:07:07,940 --> 00:07:11,860
But it belonged to my mother, and
so having it near is a comfort.

101
00:07:12,520 --> 00:07:13,991
Strange as that may seem.

102
00:07:14,840 --> 00:07:17,487
When I finally outwit
the sphinx of a mosque,

103
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:20,544
it will be the talk of
the archaeological world.

104
00:07:21,340 --> 00:07:22,460
My goodness!

105
00:07:29,380 --> 00:07:31,740
Many thanks to you, Master Dio.

106
00:07:32,320 --> 00:07:34,120
The years betray me.

107
00:07:34,620 --> 00:07:37,796
Climbing the stairs is much
harder than it was before.

108
00:07:39,440 --> 00:07:40,520
This letter!

109
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:43,520
Having read it, all has been made clear.

110
00:07:44,980 --> 00:07:45,810
Dio!

111
00:07:47,240 --> 00:07:49,840
I think he's...

112
00:07:56,440 --> 00:07:57,270
Dio!

113
00:07:58,300 --> 00:07:59,517
Wait, that's...

114
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:02,400
That's father's medicine.

115
00:08:05,140 --> 00:08:07,377
He's due for his next dosage.

116
00:08:07,460 --> 00:08:10,957
All this time, you're the one
who's been bringing it to him.

117
00:08:11,040 --> 00:08:12,460
Yes, what of it?

118
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:13,600
This letter.

119
00:08:13,880 --> 00:08:15,560
Your father sent it to mine.

120
00:08:15,960 --> 00:08:17,078
Guess what it says.

121
00:08:17,520 --> 00:08:20,580
Your lordship, sickness
has laid me right low.

122
00:08:21,340 --> 00:08:23,399
It's the end of me, whatever it is.

123
00:08:24,360 --> 00:08:25,680
My chest hurts,

124
00:08:25,980 --> 00:08:30,333
my fingers are all swollen, and I can't
breathe but for all this coughing.

125
00:08:30,500 --> 00:08:32,853
Those are the same symptoms as father's.

126
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:33,790
Blow for blow.

127
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:35,882
No way is this mere coincidence.

128
00:08:36,280 --> 00:08:37,110
Dio!

129
00:08:37,193 --> 00:08:39,081
What are you trying to say, Jojo?

130
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:41,673
I'm having a doctor look at this powder!

131
00:08:45,380 --> 00:08:46,210
Jojo,

132
00:08:46,293 --> 00:08:48,280
if you think I would poison father,

133
00:08:48,420 --> 00:08:52,780
then from this day forward,
you and I are friends no more!

134
00:08:54,820 --> 00:08:57,760
Try as I might, I can't
look Dio in the eye.

135
00:08:58,160 --> 00:08:59,800
It's because I lack proof.

136
00:09:00,100 --> 00:09:02,335
All I have to go on are my suspicions.

137
00:09:02,760 --> 00:09:06,040
Now then, if you put that
medicine back on the tray,

138
00:09:06,820 --> 00:09:10,055
I'll be willing to forget
about your lapse in judgment.

139
00:09:12,580 --> 00:09:15,756
Dio, there's only one way
you're going to convince me.

140
00:09:15,840 --> 00:09:18,137
Swear to me that the
contents of this are safe.

141
00:09:18,220 --> 00:09:19,514
Do it in Dario's name.

142
00:09:19,980 --> 00:09:22,568
Swear to me on Dario's
honor as a gentleman.

143
00:09:22,780 --> 00:09:25,721
Do that and I'll never
bring up this moment again.

144
00:09:26,800 --> 00:09:28,460
If my hunch proves true,

145
00:09:28,880 --> 00:09:32,645
his father's honor is the one lie
that will catch in his throat.

146
00:09:33,100 --> 00:09:33,930
Say it!

147
00:09:34,013 --> 00:09:34,957
What are you waiting for?

148
00:09:35,040 --> 00:09:38,140
I s-swear...

149
00:09:40,360 --> 00:09:45,320
How can I swear on the honor
of a man who didn't have any?

150
00:09:45,760 --> 00:09:47,420
He deserved to die!

151
00:09:47,620 --> 00:09:49,444
How's that for the truth, Jojo?

152
00:09:53,140 --> 00:09:55,980
You just gave me all
the proof I needed, Dio.

153
00:09:56,560 --> 00:09:58,980
At hearing his name, you lashed out.

154
00:09:59,500 --> 00:10:03,157
I don't know what he could have done
that moved you to such murderous rage,

155
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:05,005
but murder him you surely did!

156
00:10:10,800 --> 00:10:12,160
You hurt father.

157
00:10:12,360 --> 00:10:13,760
Never again, Dio.

158
00:10:22,980 --> 00:10:24,340
Damn your eyes.

159
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:26,670
Of course.

160
00:10:26,780 --> 00:10:29,157
You've been planning to
murder him for years now.

161
00:10:29,240 --> 00:10:30,070
I knew it.

162
00:10:30,153 --> 00:10:32,117
I knew that you were playing Foss with us.

163
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:34,060
But now your villainy is over.

164
00:10:35,040 --> 00:10:39,393
Once I've learned what this is, I'm
taking it to the police straight away.

165
00:10:41,880 --> 00:10:42,780
Damn it.

166
00:10:43,260 --> 00:10:45,260
Their fortune was within my grasp.

167
00:10:45,940 --> 00:10:49,260
Was it fate that Jojo
found out when he did?

168
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:50,830
No.

169
00:10:51,060 --> 00:10:52,360
It was that letter.

170
00:10:52,800 --> 00:10:54,700
He vexes me even now.

171
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:57,900
You're weak just like your mother.

172
00:10:58,340 --> 00:11:00,980
He drove her to an early grave.

173
00:11:01,700 --> 00:11:04,900
Knowing that Kerr's blood
flows through my veins.

174
00:11:05,040 --> 00:11:06,900
It's enough to drive me mad!

175
00:11:12,380 --> 00:11:15,500
Sir Joestar lives, for now.

176
00:11:23,540 --> 00:11:26,305
I'll be back from London
in a few days, Father.

177
00:11:27,100 --> 00:11:31,806
Till then, accept medicine only from the
hands of these doctors and no one else.

178
00:11:32,640 --> 00:11:35,677
Master Jojo said he doesn't
want me to bring it up.

179
00:11:35,760 --> 00:11:39,300
Yes, we will do as Jojo has instructed us.

180
00:11:41,020 --> 00:11:43,097
His reasons are a mystery to me.

181
00:11:43,180 --> 00:11:45,740
But I trust the boy with my life.

182
00:11:46,920 --> 00:11:48,040
Thank you, father.

183
00:11:49,300 --> 00:11:51,260
His illness is getting worse.

184
00:11:53,640 --> 00:11:56,860
If it is a poison, he
may need an antidote.

185
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:04,181
Whatever you may learn in
London about the poison,

186
00:12:04,500 --> 00:12:07,324
I'll see you take the
truth of it to your grave.

187
00:12:08,420 --> 00:12:11,020
Your death will be the perfect crime.

188
00:12:12,240 --> 00:12:15,737
Seven years ago, this
mask reacted to my blood.

189
00:12:15,820 --> 00:12:20,097
The spikes hidden within will
make short work of Jojo's brain.

190
00:12:20,180 --> 00:12:25,520
His injuries will be so unique, there'll
be nothing at all to tie it back to me.

191
00:12:26,700 --> 00:12:31,080
Jojo, your curiosity will
lead to your destruction.

192
00:12:37,520 --> 00:12:40,873
The university couldn't identify
this so-called medicine,

193
00:12:41,100 --> 00:12:44,924
though they did speculate that it
was a compound from the Orient.

194
00:12:46,560 --> 00:12:47,390
Therefore...

195
00:12:47,473 --> 00:12:48,303
Young Master,

196
00:12:48,460 --> 00:12:50,931
that stretch of road there is Ogre Street,

197
00:12:51,080 --> 00:12:53,357
the most dangerous
alleyway in all of London.

198
00:12:53,440 --> 00:12:58,028
Yes, I know, but this is the one place
I will be able to find what I came for.

199
00:12:58,520 --> 00:13:00,520
You're more than welcome to leave.

200
00:13:02,140 --> 00:13:03,660
Dio grew up in London.

201
00:13:03,980 --> 00:13:07,392
Where else in England could
he have acquired such a toxin?

202
00:13:07,860 --> 00:13:11,620
I shall have my evidence
and Father's antidote.

203
00:13:14,520 --> 00:13:15,820
Another dead end.

204
00:13:22,280 --> 00:13:23,260
That cat!

205
00:13:23,440 --> 00:13:25,200
It was eating a puppy.

206
00:13:29,100 --> 00:13:31,860
You do the honors, Tattoo. Right!

207
00:13:32,300 --> 00:13:34,637
Use that shiv of yours to slice him open.

208
00:13:34,720 --> 00:13:36,440
I want his guts for garters.

209
00:13:37,200 --> 00:13:38,200
Ogre Street.

210
00:13:38,440 --> 00:13:39,820
It is aptly named.

211
00:13:46,360 --> 00:13:47,700
Check out this idiot.

212
00:13:47,920 --> 00:13:49,140
He grabbed my blade.

213
00:13:49,360 --> 00:13:51,457
In all my tastes, I've
never seen the like.

214
00:13:51,540 --> 00:13:53,960
Ha-ha-ha, stuck, ain't ya?

215
00:13:54,120 --> 00:13:56,097
One quick yank of the
knife and I'll be picking

216
00:13:56,180 --> 00:13:58,537
your fingers out of the
snow for a fortnight.

217
00:13:58,620 --> 00:13:59,450
Try it, then.

218
00:13:59,740 --> 00:14:01,020
The moment you pull,

219
00:14:01,260 --> 00:14:05,037
my foot will kick out at your groin
with all the force of a sledgehammer.

220
00:14:05,120 --> 00:14:07,377
I'm willing to see our
transaction through.

221
00:14:07,460 --> 00:14:08,360
Are you, Zero?

222
00:14:08,600 --> 00:14:11,897
I'm fighting to protect my family
from those who wish it harm.

223
00:14:11,980 --> 00:14:15,098
I doubt very much that your
resolve is equal to mine.

224
00:14:19,480 --> 00:14:20,457
That's quite enough.

225
00:14:20,540 --> 00:14:25,480
Now tell me, one of you, where can I
find an Asian apothecary? Tough talk.

226
00:14:25,840 --> 00:14:29,016
If you're looking to lose
body parts, do stick around.

227
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:31,310
Observe.

228
00:14:37,840 --> 00:14:40,781
I'll mince you right finely
with a tip of the hat.

229
00:14:43,480 --> 00:14:44,960
And now we dance.

230
00:14:46,100 --> 00:14:49,537
I have to find that
apothecary, no matter the cost.

231
00:14:49,620 --> 00:14:52,840
Don't tell me this here's
your first proper dust-up!

232
00:14:53,020 --> 00:14:56,549
If you mean to block like that,
it'll be your last one, too!

233
00:15:01,280 --> 00:15:02,110
Ha-ha!

234
00:15:02,460 --> 00:15:04,797
Cut you straight to the bone, looks like.

235
00:15:04,880 --> 00:15:07,757
Granted, I didn't think you'd
hooved the shiv at me like that,

236
00:15:07,840 --> 00:15:09,840
but my Cheap still hit its mark.

237
00:15:15,120 --> 00:15:18,597
Now I know why he weren't
defending himself better.

238
00:15:18,680 --> 00:15:20,560
Fingers, hands, legs.

239
00:15:20,860 --> 00:15:23,036
He don't care one whit what he loses.

240
00:15:23,200 --> 00:15:26,400
It's as if his resolve runs
deeper than pain or fear.

241
00:15:26,880 --> 00:15:28,840
I took the lad for an easy mark.

242
00:15:29,220 --> 00:15:31,985
Guess I've been right
disabused of that notion.

243
00:15:41,760 --> 00:15:42,590
What?

244
00:15:42,800 --> 00:15:44,960
JoJo went to Ogre Street on his own?

245
00:15:45,880 --> 00:15:47,760
I told him it was perilous.

246
00:15:48,440 --> 00:15:49,734
Keep this to yourself.

247
00:15:49,880 --> 00:15:52,500
Sir Joestar is still unwell. Yes, sir.

248
00:15:53,440 --> 00:15:56,205
I guess I won't need to
use the mask after all.

249
00:15:56,560 --> 00:15:59,340
There, alone, his fate is sealed.

250
00:16:02,820 --> 00:16:04,080
That's enough, lads.

251
00:16:04,380 --> 00:16:08,760
I won't let a single one of you lay
a finger on that gentleman there.

252
00:16:09,980 --> 00:16:10,960
But why?

253
00:16:11,340 --> 00:16:12,440
Tell me something.

254
00:16:13,300 --> 00:16:15,877
Strong as a bull you
are, it's plain to see.

255
00:16:15,960 --> 00:16:18,997
You could have stove my head
in with that foot of yours,

256
00:16:19,080 --> 00:16:21,198
but you went easy on me, didn't you?

257
00:16:23,880 --> 00:16:26,560
I came here for the sake of my father.

258
00:16:27,040 --> 00:16:28,099
You have a family.

259
00:16:28,400 --> 00:16:31,694
People who expect you to
return from this dark business.

260
00:16:31,880 --> 00:16:34,500
It is not my place to cause them grief.

261
00:16:35,160 --> 00:16:36,940
He means it, don't he?

262
00:16:37,400 --> 00:16:40,420
How this Fool survived so long. Wait.

263
00:16:42,660 --> 00:16:45,760
He spared my mate's lives
just like he did mine.

264
00:16:46,580 --> 00:16:48,280
I like the cut of his jib.

265
00:16:48,660 --> 00:16:52,601
Sure he's naïve, but he's a gentleman
through and through this one.

266
00:16:52,760 --> 00:16:55,407
I want to know the name
of him who spared me.

267
00:16:57,380 --> 00:16:58,500
Jonathan Joestar.

268
00:16:59,360 --> 00:17:01,557
Well, pleased to make your acquaintance.

269
00:17:01,640 --> 00:17:04,897
If it's Asian concoctions you're
looking for, mind your back.

270
00:17:04,980 --> 00:17:07,340
The druggist is one sly customer.

271
00:17:09,860 --> 00:17:13,077
So Joestar, JoJo's been gone three days.

272
00:17:13,160 --> 00:17:15,877
Whatever is there and he'll accomplish it.

273
00:17:15,960 --> 00:17:18,097
Where have the years gone? I wonder.

274
00:17:18,180 --> 00:17:19,897
He's grown into a fine man.

275
00:17:19,980 --> 00:17:24,360
I cannot help but wonder if I was
too hard on the boy. Growing up.

276
00:17:35,360 --> 00:17:38,997
I'm sure Jojo's laying
dead in some alley by now.

277
00:17:39,080 --> 00:17:41,800
Did he find the apothecary?

278
00:17:43,320 --> 00:17:45,177
Look at me, swilling it down.

279
00:17:45,260 --> 00:17:47,377
Nothing but a drunken fool.

280
00:17:47,460 --> 00:17:49,497
Just like my bastard father.

281
00:17:49,580 --> 00:17:50,440
Damn it!

282
00:17:53,460 --> 00:17:57,460
Watch yourself Or have you no
respect for your elders, boy?

283
00:17:58,280 --> 00:17:59,537
Look at the baby.

284
00:17:59,620 --> 00:18:01,217
Tolling round past bedtime.

285
00:18:01,300 --> 00:18:04,065
Sucking on a bowl like
it was his mother's tea.

286
00:18:04,780 --> 00:18:06,517
Look at the man when he's talking.

287
00:18:06,600 --> 00:18:08,718
Didn't your old man teach you right?

288
00:18:12,480 --> 00:18:15,833
Just for that, I'm going to
take your face clean off you!

289
00:18:16,360 --> 00:18:20,380
Oh, your threat has me quaking in
my boots, you old gutter-snipe.

290
00:18:20,520 --> 00:18:23,226
How will I escape this
moment of mortal peril?

291
00:18:24,480 --> 00:18:27,380
How about we use this?

292
00:18:28,040 --> 00:18:32,040
It's meant for Jojo, but
you'll make a fine guinea pig.

293
00:18:32,300 --> 00:18:33,580
Just die already!

294
00:18:36,440 --> 00:18:38,100
Let's see what you can do!

295
00:18:47,580 --> 00:18:49,880
What is that light?

296
00:19:03,180 --> 00:19:05,820
All of that spectacle for nothing.

297
00:19:07,160 --> 00:19:08,060
Useless.

298
00:19:08,640 --> 00:19:10,077
That was boring.

299
00:19:10,160 --> 00:19:12,760
I expected more from you, Mask.

300
00:19:28,920 --> 00:19:29,880
Impossible.

301
00:19:33,980 --> 00:19:35,420
He's alive!

302
00:19:38,500 --> 00:19:41,380
That face those teeth

303
00:19:53,780 --> 00:19:56,080
What incredible strength

304
00:20:04,440 --> 00:20:06,520
Even now, he advances.

305
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:09,780
But his hand, does the pain mean nothing?

306
00:20:10,200 --> 00:20:13,600
He shattered my shoulder
with but a glancing blow.

307
00:20:15,640 --> 00:20:18,560
The river, I must jump in.

308
00:20:24,880 --> 00:20:26,240
It's odd.

309
00:20:26,860 --> 00:20:31,280
I was drinking through the night, but
suddenly I got such a brutal thirst.

310
00:20:31,720 --> 00:20:34,160
My blood is draining him.

311
00:20:37,020 --> 00:20:37,980
What the?

312
00:20:38,980 --> 00:20:41,760
So this is the secret of the mask.

313
00:20:42,260 --> 00:20:43,660
I'm dying.

314
00:20:48,560 --> 00:20:49,390
No!

315
00:20:49,473 --> 00:20:50,540
I had such plans!

316
00:20:50,860 --> 00:20:53,978
Must my last sight on Earth
be this damnable sunrise?

317
00:21:12,340 --> 00:21:14,760
The sun destroyed him.

318
00:21:36,060 --> 00:21:37,648
What's the meaning of this?

319
00:21:37,780 --> 00:21:39,460
Why is it so bloody dark?

320
00:21:43,380 --> 00:21:44,210
Jojo.

321
00:21:44,420 --> 00:21:46,397
You're a poisoner, Dio Brando.

322
00:21:46,480 --> 00:21:49,580
I have all the proof I
require and then some.

323
00:22:16,480 --> 00:22:22,880
I spend the day your way, call it morning,

324
00:22:22,980 --> 00:22:25,980
driving through the sun,
and in and out the valley.

325
00:22:36,400 --> 00:22:43,137
The music dance and sing, they
make the children really ring.

326
00:22:43,220 --> 00:22:47,380
I spend the day your way.

327
00:22:48,580 --> 00:22:51,297
Cold in morning, driving through the sun.

328
00:22:51,380 --> 00:22:53,280
And in and out the valley.

329
00:22:55,160 --> 00:22:57,740
In and out around the lake.

330
00:22:58,940 --> 00:23:01,177
Mountains come out of the sky.

331
00:23:01,260 --> 00:23:02,840
And they'll stand there.

332
00:23:06,000 --> 00:23:08,137
When my lover will be there.

333
00:23:08,220 --> 00:23:09,620
And we'll see you.

334
00:23:12,520 --> 00:23:15,980
Ten-two summers, we'll
be there laughing too.

335
00:23:19,040 --> 00:23:21,717
Twenty-four, we'll find
out that we'll see.

336
00:23:21,800 --> 00:23:24,780
I'll be there with you.

337
00:23:29,220 --> 00:23:32,877
Jojo, I've been a devil,
but grant me this one wish.

338
00:23:32,960 --> 00:23:35,237
This fellow reeks of brimstone and blood.

339
00:23:35,320 --> 00:23:38,097
You see, I am about to
become so much more.

340
00:23:38,180 --> 00:23:39,020
Dio!
